    "detailed_description": "Join the ranks of history's greatest generals and redefine the outcomes of the most significant battles of the Napoleonic era. All it takes is a strategic mind and the will to command. Dive into our game now on Steam and lead your troops to glory!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/0713cb93b6a97d952892d4591658f3ce.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=315 /></span><br>Dive into 6 detailed campaigns each representing a pivotal phase of the Napoleonic Wars \u2014 from Preussisch-Eylau in 1807 to the battles of 1814. Each campaign offers a series of battles that shaped the course of history, bringing over 150 missions to your screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/d47ee28e3363e8fd40af10bfda920337.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each mission showcases a historical battlefield with meticulously positioned army regiments, bringing military history battle maps directly to your screen. Historical accuracy meets tactical gameplay here, where the positioning and terrain play as much a role as your regiments and decisions.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/25c4710007f299a1b980dbbf5a0f59d8.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>We've meticulously recreated the authentic design of Napoleonic Wars-era army regiments, complete with historically accurate uniforms and capabilities. It's not just about classifying units as infantry, cavalry, or artillery; it\u2019s about the unique history of each specific regiment, which can significantly impact their role on the battlefield.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/741a32d4efb4d179c62d0dbf393d55a4.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To provide full immersion of battlefield command, we\u2019ve combined turn-based elements like hexagonal grid movement with the simultaneous actions characteristic of RTS. This results in gameplay with a more deliberate pace, where quick reflexes aren\u2019t essential\u2014only a keen strategic mind. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/aa1bae767190a9ba706ac705f6b4ef77.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leverage historical formations like squares, columns, or skirmish lines to gain tactical advantages on the battlefield. Transform your units dynamically to suit the unfolding tactical scenario. With a system designed to minimize randomness, predict the outcome of your strategies and attacks with high accuracy, similar to traditional tabletop wargaming.",
    "about_the_game": "Join the ranks of history's greatest generals and redefine the outcomes of the most significant battles of the Napoleonic era. All it takes is a strategic mind and the will to command. Dive into our game now on Steam and lead your troops to glory!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/0713cb93b6a97d952892d4591658f3ce.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=315 /></span><br>Dive into 6 detailed campaigns each representing a pivotal phase of the Napoleonic Wars \u2014 from Preussisch-Eylau in 1807 to the battles of 1814. Each campaign offers a series of battles that shaped the course of history, bringing over 150 missions to your screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/d47ee28e3363e8fd40af10bfda920337.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/bc4db9dee89f7fe2d0a998ac983e9d15.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each mission showcases a historical battlefield with meticulously positioned army regiments, bringing military history battle maps directly to your screen. Historical accuracy meets tactical gameplay here, where the positioning and terrain play as much a role as your regiments and decisions.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/25c4710007f299a1b980dbbf5a0f59d8.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>We've meticulously recreated the authentic design of Napoleonic Wars-era army regiments, complete with historically accurate uniforms and capabilities. It's not just about classifying units as infantry, cavalry, or artillery; it\u2019s about the unique history of each specific regiment, which can significantly impact their role on the battlefield.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/741a32d4efb4d179c62d0dbf393d55a4.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/e9efa4afe88d4c5186c5ded2e42f41cf.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To provide full immersion of battlefield command, we\u2019ve combined turn-based elements like hexagonal grid movement with the simultaneous actions characteristic of RTS. This results in gameplay with a more deliberate pace, where quick reflexes aren\u2019t essential\u2014only a keen strategic mind. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/aa1bae767190a9ba706ac705f6b4ef77.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.poster.avif?t=1727941200\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.webm?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096190/extras/def4f4df202e7d3c947d96759ada8eb6.mp4?t=1727941200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leverage historical formations like squares, columns, or skirmish lines to gain tactical advantages on the battlefield. Transform your units dynamically to suit the unfolding tactical scenario. With a system designed to minimize randomness, predict the outcome of your strategies and attacks with high accuracy, similar to traditional tabletop wargaming.",
    "short_description": "Inspired by legendary classic wargames , Combat Directive brings the strategic depth and ideological brilliance of these classics to life, reimagining the monumental battles of the Napoleonic Wars. It's crafted for the true enthusiasts of historical warfare.",
